        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>14\" Square Stainless Steel Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 14\" stainless steel door handles features an easy to grip square pull handle that is very comfortable. For use on residential and commercial doors such as storefront doors. The warm <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b> finish requiring little maintenance, designed to enhance any setting where a clean, contemporary look is desired. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-SIG443-335-speifications.gif?v=1704354619\" width=\"587\" height=\"255\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Square Stainless Steel Glass Door Pull Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/24-inch-square-door-handles-satin-stainless-steel\"><b>2 Foot Square Stainless Steel Door Handle</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/36-inch-square-door-handle-satin-stainless-steel\"><b>36\" Square Stainless Steel Door Handle</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/48-inch-square-door-handles-satin-stainless-steel\"><b>48\" Square Stainless Steel Door Handle</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/60-inch-square-door-handles-satin-stainless-steel\"><b>60\" Square Stainless Steel Door Handle</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Square Stainless Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li> \r\n<li>Total Length: 14\" (355 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 6\" (152 mm) C/C</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-3/16\" (81 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 1-1/8\" (29 mm) Square</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "14 Inch Square Door Handle",
                "description": "These 14 inch stainless steel door handle feature an easy to grip square pull handle that is very comfortable. Optional mounting kits for use on wood, metal or glass doors.  For use on residential and commercial doors such as storefront doors. Warm Satin Stainless Steel finish requiring little maintenance, designed to enhance any setting where a clean contemporary look is desired.",
                "keywords": "DWD-443-355-630 14 Inch square Stainless Door Pulls, 14 Inch Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Pulls, AHI SIG443-355-630 Brushed Stainless Steel Door Pulls, AHI SIG443-355 door pulls, 14 inch commercial door pulls, storefront door pulls, storefront stainless door pulls, stainless storefront door pulls, 1 foot door pulls, Square Door Handles, Square Door pulls,"
